# Architecture («Архитектура»); epic then split («Разбиение»)
File id only: `playbook-step-02-architecture.mdc`.

Map only what the analysis section justified. Add no field, screen, or block that section omitted. Do not redesign product layout. An unresolved how goes to «Решения», not to a new column.

Refuse feature Архитектура until that feature's Аналитика meets the bar in `playbook-step-01-analysis.mdc`. Epic Бизнес-анализ alone never unlocks feature code.

- Epic column Архитектура: services, boundaries, and integration options, and why the option was chosen. No field catalog and no screen layout.
- Epic column Разбиение, only after that architecture text is visible: a feature list with one line for why each feature exists. Each line is a Feature wiki page and a child issue. Children are features or bug-features. No other child type.
- Feature column Архитектура, including a bug-feature: model, API (method, path, access, body, response, errors), contracts, and migrations only for items Аналитика justified. A slice that needs its own product analysis is another Feature under the same epic.
- A typo fix inside an open feature does not add an architecture section and does not add fields.
- Business part unclear: do not rewrite it. Options go to «Решения».
- Every important choice is one «Решения» row. An impactful how that is not already authorized goes to the owner via the lead. Once that row has «Выбрано», or the owner already put this task in work, a matching PR does not need a second yes at merge (`00-core.mdc`). An empty «Выбрано» on a row for this slice blocks Разработка (`playbook-step-03-decisions.mdc`).
